	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"「機動戦士ガンダムSEED C.E.73-STARGAZER-」より“ブルデュエルガンダム”がBB戦士に登場 前腕に収納されているビームガンは差し替えで、手に持たせる事が可能 左肩のハッチは差し替えで開閉、内部にMk315スティレットを収納可能 手にMk315スティレットを持った投擲シーン再現用パーツが付属"
		],
		"en": [
			"\"Bull Duel Gundam\" from \"Mobile Suit GundamSEED C.E.73-STARGAZER-\" appears in BB Senshi. The beam gun stored in the forearm can be replaced and held in the hand. The hatch on the left shoulder can be opened and closed by replacing it, and a Mk315 Stiletto can be stored inside. Parts are included to recreate the throwing scene with the Mk315 Stiletto in hand."
		]
	},
